      "content": "It is technically difficult to introduce concentrated neuro-stimulants into HVAC systems without causing dangerous health risks or severe allergic reactions for customers. Even if such compounds existed that triggered cravings, state health codes and strict regulations would likely prohibit their use in public spaces where thousands of people are present. While companies use marketing psychology effectively, they avoid direct physiological manipulation due to legal and ethical constraints.",
